B.UD=new A.hP("I'm Ehsan Abaci, a software developer specializing in Flutter and Dart, with almost 3 years of experience in building cross-platform applications for Android, iOS, Web, and Windows. My focus is on creating scalable, maintainable, and high-performance applications using clean architecture and modern state management solutions such as Bloc and Provider.\n\nI am currently studying Computer Engineering, which strengthens my knowledge in software design, algorithms, and system architecture, and allows me to combine academic foundations with practical, real-world development skills.\n\nI am passionate about writing clean, modular code, designing intuitive user experiences, and ensuring that every product I develop meets both technical efficiency and real-world usability. My work often involves integrating advanced features like background services, push notifications, and real-time communication, while maintaining a strong emphasis on performance optimization and cross-platform compatibility.\n\nI am driven by continuous learning, problem-solving, and innovation, and I strive to deliver software that makes a meaningful impact.\n",null,null,null,null,null,null)
